# Symbolization problems (notation 1).
# Format: see data/README.md. Fields:
#   problem:                 problem name, as shown in the problem list
#   options:                 per-problem options, e.g. eg (a worked example)
#   note:                    note shown under the problem title
#   common-name:             common name of the problem (course database)
#   original-name:           name the problem was copied from
#   errors:                  error count (saved work)
#   seconds:                 time worked, in seconds (saved work)
#   english:                 the English sentence
#   node:                    a node of the symbolization tree, 'code:English', in pre-order
#   scheme:                  scheme of abbreviation, 'symbol:English' items separated by '.'
#   answer-keys:             answer-key names (see symbolization-answers.rec), separated by '.'
#   answer-group:            problems in the same group share their answers
#   hints:                   hint count (saved work)

# basesymprobs.txt: base homework problems

