answer-keys: 2\.077

problem: Symb 2.078
node: ?:Although Richard will be disappointed unless the critics approve, the concert will be worthwhile if and only if the music is played well.
scheme: P:  Richard will be disappointed.     R:  the critics approve.     T:  the concert will be worthwhile.     W:  the music is played well
answer-keys: 2\.078.2\.078b

problem: Symb 2.079
node: ?:Neither Donald nor Richard is eager, but each is willing if the other is.
