answer-keys: 2\.088
note: Hint: Remember, from the Examples file, that we have adopted a convention whereby the standard symbolization of a series, such as "P and Q and R and S" is to be associated to the left.

problem: Symb 2.089
node: ?:If the world is a progressively realized community of interpretation, then either quadruplicity drinks procrastination or, provided that the Nothing negates, boredom will ensue seldom more often than frequently.
scheme: W:  the world is a progressively realized community of interpretation.     Q:  quadruplicity drinks procrastination.     X:  the Nothing negates.     R:  boredom will ensue seldom more often than frequently
answer-keys: 2\.089

