node: ?:Errors will occur in the subject's performance if and only if motivation is absent or learning has not taken place. [Ambiguous]
scheme: R:  Errors will occur in the subject's perfornamce.     T:  motivation is absent.     U:  learning has occurred
answer-keys: 2\.090

